---
title: New game
sidebar:
  order: 3
---

These settings in `dx/config.h` decide where a new game starts:

```c
#define NEW_GAME_ENTRY $kmr_20.GameStart
#define NEW_GAME_STORY_PROGRESS STORY_INTRO
```

| Setting | What it sets |
| --- | --- |
| `NEW_GAME_ENTRY` | The [entry](/papermario-dx/world/entries-and-exits/) where the player appears, as a map's entry marker, such as `$kmr_20.GameStart` |
| `NEW_GAME_STORY_PROGRESS` | How far through the story the new game starts |
